  {
   "text": "HAMELIN, 1284",
   "style": "engraved",
   "start": 1.86,
   "end": 3.36
  },
  {
   "text": "THE TOWN WAS OVERRUN BY RATS.",
   "style": "story",
   "start": 3.64,
   "end": 6.909
  },
  {
   "text": "A MYSTERIOUS STRANGER OFFERED A SOLUTION.",
   "style": "story",
   "start": 14.118,
   "end": 17.547
  },
  {
   "text": "THEN HE BEGAN TO PLAY.",
   "style": "story",
   "start": 17.757,
   "end": 19.292
  },
  {
   "text": "THE RATS DISAPPEARED.",
   "style": "story",
   "start": 28.235,
   "end": 29.9
  },
  {
   "text": "BUT THE TOWN REFUSED TO PAY.",
   "style": "story",
   "start": 35.294,
   "end": 37.909
  },
  {
   "text": "SO HE RETURNED.",
   "style": "story",
   "start": 39.265,
   "end": 40.348
  },
  {
   "text": "THIS TIME, THE RATS STAYED STILL.",
   "style": "story",
   "start": 42.353,
   "end": 44.018
  },
  {
   "text": "THE CHILDREN FOLLOWED INSTEAD.",
   "style": "story",
   "start": 45.882,
   "end": 47.507
  },
  {
   "text": "THEY NEVER RETURNED.",
   "style": "story",
   "start": 58.235,
   "end": 59.9
  },
  {
   "text": "According to legend, 130 children vanished.",
   "style": "legend",
   "start": 60.15,
   "end": 63.309
  },
  {
   "text": "THE PIED PIPER OF HAMELIN",
